  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 522.05 Construction Requirements for Agricultural Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 522.05 Construction Requirements for Agricultural Projects. In addition to all applicable construction standards specified in Env-Wt 307, agricultural projects shall comply with the Agriculture BMWPs, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
